# Direct Python dependencies of the code generator and its gates.
#
# Edit THIS file, not requirements.txt. requirements.txt is the lock that
# pip-compile writes from this file: every package, transitive ones included,
# at an exact version, so CI, dev machines and the scanners (pip-audit,
# OSV-Scanner) all see the same set. Regenerate it with Python 3.12, the
# version CI uses; see docs/knowledge/dependency-and-resource-controls.md
# ("Python lock file").
